WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.220
By the Sea of Galilee, two brothers,
Simon and Andrew, are fishing.

2
00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:10.780
Jesus calls out: come after me, and
I will make you into fishers for men.

3
00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:13.050
Immediately they leave their nets.

4
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:17.380
Two more brothers, James and John, leave
their father in the boat with the hired

5
00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:18.590
men.

6
00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:23.800
So why would fishermen drop their
nets on the spot to follow a stranger?

7
00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:26.630
In this mission, you'll
see who else Jesus called,

8
00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:30.300
including a tax collector,
seen by many as a traitor.

9
00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:33.780
Then you'll follow the Twelve
as they are sent out two by two,

10
00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:36.500
and see what that mission asked of them.

11
00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:41.270
Your mission: find out why fishermen would
drop their nets on the spot to follow

12
00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:41.720
him.
